  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "May is new in class. Teacher Kim says, \"This is May.\" \"Hello, May!\" says the class. May smiles.",
      "\"Listen, please,\" says Teacher Kim. \"Open your book.\" May opens her book. \"Look at the board.\" The board has three colors. They are red, green, and purple.",
      "\"Point to red,\" says Teacher Kim. May points to red. \"Thumbs up!\" says the class. \"Point to purple,\" says Mia. Oh! May points to green. \"Try again,\" says Teacher Kim. May points to purple. \"Wow!\" says Mia. Is it good? Yes!"
    ],
    "summary": "May is new in class. She opens her book, looks at the board, and points to red, green, and purple.",
